<title>HUNGARY: Hungary to export 1.2 mln T wheat in 2nd half 1996.</title>
<headline>Hungary to export 1.2 mln T wheat in 2nd half 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary is to export 1.2 million tonnes of wheat in the second half of 1996, a Trade and Industry Ministry (IKM) official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The total wheat and flour export in the second half of 1996 will be 1.2 million tonnes of wheat equivalent,&quot; Lajos Berenyi, secretary of state at the IKM, told a news conference.</p>
</text>
